<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Australian Hardcourt Championships on Monday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Michael Tebbutt (Australia) 7-5 1-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) beat 7-Renzo Furlan (Italy) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>5-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Marc Kevin Goellner (Germany) 6-7 (7-5) 6-4 7-6 (11-9)</p>
<p>2-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat 1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 4-6 6-3 6-3.</p>
</text>
